```css
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f4f8f7;
    color: #111111;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

header {
    min-height: 90vh;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b7285, #2f9e44);
    color: white;
    padding: 30px 8%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
}

header .site-label {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

header h1 {
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: 900px;
}

header p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 750px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.hero-buttons a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.primary-button {
    background-color: white;
    color: #0b7285;
}

.secondary-button {
    border: 2px solid white;
    color: white;
}

nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background-color: white;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e2e1;
    padding: 14px 8%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
}

nav a {
    color: #111111;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #0b7285;
}

section {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 8%;
}

.section-label {
    color: #0b7285;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

h2 {
    font-size: 2.7rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: #111111;
}

h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: #0b7285;
}

.divider {
    width: 80px;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0b7285, #2f9e44);
    margin: 24px 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
}

.card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 30px;
}

.card {
    background-color: white;
    border: 1px solid #d9e2e1;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
}

.card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
}

.highlight-box {
    background-color: white;
    border-left: 6px solid #2f9e44;
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    margin: 28px 0;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
}

.media-block {
    background-color: white;
    border: 1px solid #d9e2e1;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin: 30px 0;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
}

img {
    max-width: 100%;
    display: block;
    margin: 20px auto;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid #d9e2e1;
}

.caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #444444;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: -8px;
}

.video-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 22px auto;
}

.video-container iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 500px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: none;
}

.about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 30px;
}

.person-card {
    background-color: white;
    border: 1px solid #d9e2e1;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
}

.initial {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b7285, #2f9e44);
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

a {
    color: #0b7285;
}

footer {
    background-color: #062f35;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px 8%;
}

footer a {
    color: white;
}

@media (max-width: 800px) {
    header h1 {
        font-size: 2.7rem;
    }

    .card-grid,
    .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .video-container iframe {
        height: 300px;
    }
}
```
